      "text": "$(thing)Machine data$(): a multiblock (16 item and 16 fluid inputs, 4 and 4 outputs).$(br2)$(thing)Makes$(): Absolute Singularity, Echo of the Transcendental, Eschaton Cell, Eschaton Core."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "theoreticalsciences:eschaton_foundry",
      "text": "Made in $(item)Femtoscale Assembly Line$()."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "theoreticalsciences:femtoscale_assembly_line",
      "text": "Made in a crafting grid."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "theoreticalsciences:absolute_singularity",
      "text": "Not a point where the laws break down: a point where there are no laws to break.$(br2)Made in $(item)Eschaton Foundry$()."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "theoreticalsciences:transcendental_echo",
      "text": "The last ringing of a destroyed dimension, caught before it faded. It is the shape of the place, without the place.$(br2)Made in $(item)Eschaton Foundry$()."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "theoreticalsciences:eschaton_cell",
      "text": "The end of all things, metered out in doses. What the last artefacts burn to stay what they are.$(br2)Made in $(item)Conceptual Singularity Compressor$()."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "theoreticalsciences:eschaton_core",
      "text": "The end of all things, held still in a cage of Omnipotent metal. Every endgame artefact is built around one.$(br2)Made in $(item)Eschaton Foundry$()."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(thing)Where these go$():$(li)$(item)Absolute Singularity$(): Echo of the Transcendental, Eschaton Cell, Eschaton Core$(li)$(item)Echo of the Transcendental$(): Eschaton Foundry, Rekindled Spark$(li)$(item)Eschaton Core$(): Eschaton Cell"
    }
